---
title: AIHE-EX05: Local Validation Report Template
---
flowchart TD
 S1["1. Define the local decision and intended use\nSpecify the population, setting, user, decision window, comparator, expected action, consequence of error, accountable owner, and exact system version."]
 S2["2. Define the validation cohort and evidence period\nRecord inclusion and exclusion criteria, data provenance, reference standard, missingness, representation, timing, and transformations or mappings."]
 S1 --> S2
 S3["3. Evaluate predictive or diagnostic performance\nAssess discrimination, calibration, sensitivity, specificity, predictive values, error burden, threshold-specific performance, and uncertainty as appropriate."]
 S2 --> S3
 S4["4. Examine subgroup and workflow performance\nAssess relevant subgroups, human–AI interaction, response capacity, overrides, action latency, workarounds, and balancing measures."]
 S3 --> S4
 S5["5. Assess clinical utility and decision consequences\nDetermine whether the output improves a defined decision or pathway relative to the comparator; keep validation separate from causal claims about downstream outcomes."]
 S4 --> S5
 S6["6. Record limitations and decision conditions\nState evidence gaps, mitigation, monitoring, restrictions, additional evidence, and conditions for proceeding, piloting, recalibrating, deferring, or stopping."]
 S5 --> S6
 S7["7. Approve and preserve the versioned record\nRecord accountable authority, evidence cut-off, decision date, dissent, next review date, and triggers for revalidation after material change."]
 S6 --> S7
 classDef process fill:#fff,stroke:#7A1730,stroke-width:2px,color:#222
 class S1,S2,S3,S4,S5,S6,S7 process
